# SYNTHETIC INPUT: nothing here is from the recording and nothing is the owner's input.
# Written by the planner on 12 October 2026 (NOTES.md, 08:36 and after): what a person's hand
# does that the other scripts never did.  The owner's first played session ended when he
# released the right mouse button (the default processing of WM_RBUTTONUP was not built);
# this script presses what he can press, so that such a stop is found by a hidden run and
# not by him.
#
#   GATE3_INPUT_SCRIPT=gate3/synthetic/person-proof.script build/gate3/gate3 run
#
# The first two sections are continue.script's, unchanged (the click on "New Game", the
# space bar on the loading screen).  Times are milliseconds after the anchor fired.

anchor mark main-menu
3000 moveto 375 577
3400 button left down
3480 button left up

anchor mark mission-frame
5000 key down 32
5120 key up 32

# The right button, held and released (aiming).
25000 button right down
25400 button right up

# Three quick presses of the left button at one place: a press, a double click, a press.
26000 button left down
26080 button left up
26200 button left down
26280 button left up
26400 button left down
26480 button left up

# The same for the right and the middle button.
27000 button right down
27080 button right up
27200 button right down
27280 button right up
28000 button middle down
28080 button middle up
28200 button middle down
28280 button middle up

# The right button held while the mouse moves and the left is pressed (aim and fire).
29000 button right down
29200 move 40 0
29400 button left down
29480 button left up
29600 move -40 0
29800 button right up
